/target
/aret_out
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
*.o
*.obj
.claude/settings.local.json

# sqlite_sweep downloads/caches the real sqlite3.exe here (large, versioned online).
# Ignore the *contents* (glob, not the dir itself) so specific files below can be
# re-included — a directory-level ignore cannot be negated per-file.
bench/.cache/*
# ...except the fixed corpus binaries we commit so they survive an ephemeral
# container (funcdiff/regression targets — sources are third-party and versioned
# online, but pinned here so a session never loses them). Keep this list in sync
# with bench/.cache/README.md.
!bench/.cache/README.md
!bench/.cache/busybox-w32-FRP-5579-g5749feb35.exe
!bench/.cache/sqlite3-3400100.exe
!bench/.cache/winetest.exe
tools/__pycache__/
# Store de test créé hors du module ARET-MMU ; le Store canonique est
# aret-memory/.aret-memory/ et demeure explicitement versionné.
/.aret-memory/

# État local éphémère de la barrière de reprise ARET-MMU ; ni mémoire canonique ni preuve.
aret-memory/.aret-memory/runtime/
scratchpad/
